  "title_en": "Xi's Quotes: Health is 1, All Else is 0",
  "summary_zh": "习近平总书记强调'健康是幸福生活最重要的指标'，全民健身日之际重温讲话，倡导健康生活方式。",
  "summary_en": "President Xi Jinping stressed that health is the most important indicator of happiness. On National Fitness Day, his remarks are revisited to promote healthy lifestyles.",
